\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces CAP-KVC system architecture. Environmental sensors (blue) feed a deterministic scoring function that selects contexts for background priming (green). The multimodal intent pipeline (purple) combines sEMG and gaze inputs via late fusion. At inference time (orange), the pre-computed KV cache is restored and only intent tokens are processed by the llama.cpp/JNI backend. A periodic drift detector re-evaluates context relevance with hysteresis gating ($\Delta \geq 0.10$).}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{4}{CAP-KVC system architecture. Environmental sensors (blue) feed a deterministic scoring function that selects contexts for background priming (green). The multimodal intent pipeline (purple) combines sEMG and gaze inputs via late fusion. At inference time (orange), the pre-computed KV cache is restored and only intent tokens are processed by the llama.cpp/JNI backend. A periodic drift detector re-evaluates context relevance with hysteresis gating ($\Delta \geq 0.10$)}{figure.1}{}}
