\newlabel{tab:prediction}{{III}{11}{Prediction routing accuracy and residency metrics across 100 controlled synthetic daily episodes (6,400 total interactions, seed=42). Hit@1: top-ranked state matches ground truth. Hit@3: ground truth is actually resident in the $k\!=\!3$ cache at interaction time. Cold miss: ground truth absent from cache. Wrong context: cache contains ground truth but top-1 selection differs. True single-modality ablations set $w_t \approx 0$ to isolate individual sensors}{table.3}{}}
